00:11:04.780 --> 00:11:07.840
Her idea of having Jim talk to her dad did not go well.
她让吉姆去跟她爸谈谈的想法，结果并不好。

277
00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:10.820
Apparently, her dad is now looking for an apartment.
显然，她爸现在正在找公寓。

278
00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:13.660
And the divorce is on.
而且婚离定了。

279
00:11:13.820 --> 00:11:14.360
