事情正在发生。

280
00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:16.220
Pam gets really worried.
帕姆变得非常担心。

281
00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:21.540
She has this talking head where she says, what could Jim have said to make my dad want
她有个采访镜头，说吉姆到底说了什么，才让她爸想要

282
00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:22.400
to leave my mom?
离开她妈？

283
00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:26.620
And at what point in their marriage is Jim going to say this to her?
而且吉姆会在他们婚姻的哪个阶段对她说这种话？

284
00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:27.980
She's spiraling.
她快崩溃了。

285
00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:29.300
I think she's spiraling.
我觉得她快崩溃了。

286
00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:29.480
Yeah.
是啊。

287
00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:30.460
I mean, that's a big leap.
我是说，这跨度太大了。

288
00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:31.520
That's a big jump.
这跳跃太大了。

289
00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:32.540
But she's upset.
但她很心烦。

290
00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:33.960
And she's scared.
而且她很害怕。

291
00:11:34.220 --> 00:11:34.680
Right?
对吧？

