然后我会抬头看向窗户，诸如此类的动作。

908
00:37:50.870 --> 00:37:51.570
So, yeah.
所以，没错。

909
00:37:52.210 --> 00:37:53.310
But he was great.
但他真的很棒。

910
00:37:53.610 --> 00:37:57.590
And by the way, he reached out to us because he knew we were coming up on this episode.
顺便说一下，他主动联系我们，因为他知道我们快要聊到这一集了。

911
00:37:57.590 --> 00:38:02.030
And he said, if you would not mind, would you tell people that I have a new improvised
他说，如果不介意的话，能不能告诉大家我有一个新的即兴

912
00:38:02.030 --> 00:38:05.130
stand-up special called Rick Overton's Set List?
单口喜剧特辑，叫《瑞克·奥弗顿的节目单》？

913
00:38:05.210 --> 00:38:07.750
And you can find it through Comedy Dynamics.
你可以通过Comedy Dynamics找到它。

914
00:38:07.910 --> 00:38:08.570
Oh, nice.
哦，不错。

915
00:38:08.830 --> 00:38:11.690
And we can put a link in the show notes for anyone who wants to check it out.
我们可以在节目简介里放个链接，方便想看的人去了解一下。

916
00:38:11.770 --> 00:38:12.310
That's great.
那太好了。

917
00:38:12.590 --> 00:38:17.110
Well, this all leads us into this Pam talking head that gets quoted back to me all the time.
好吧，这一切引出了帕姆的那段采访，人们总是拿那段话来引用给我听。

918
00:38:17.850 --> 00:38:20.050
It's a very sweet talking head.
那是一段非常温馨的采访。

919
00:38:20.110 --> 00:38:20.890
It is.
确实。

920
00:38:21.410 --> 00:38:24.890
Pam says, when you're young, you assume your parents are soulmates.
帕姆说，当你年轻的时候，你会认为你的父母是灵魂伴侣。

921
00:38:25.530 --> 00:38:27.330
Her kids are going to be right about that.
她的孩子们以后也会有这种感觉的。

922
00:38:27.330 --> 00:38:27.790
Yeah.
没错。

923
00:38:28.590 --> 00:38:33.490
Andy overhears it, throws papers in the air, because he's like, his whole running bit is
安迪无意中听到了，把纸扔向空中，因为他觉得，他整个角色的梗就是

924
00:38:33.490 --> 00:38:38.710
that Pam and Jim are sort of relationship geniuses and that they can see all of this
帕姆和吉姆是某种恋爱天才，他们能看出电影里所有

925
00:38:38.710 --> 00:38:40.830
stuff happening in a movie that he can't see.
他看不出来的东西。

926
00:38:40.850 --> 00:38:41.130
Yes.
是的。

927
00:38:41.430 --> 00:38:47.510
This deep relationship-like storyline that he just can't see, because it's not there, Andy.
这种深奥的恋爱剧情他就是看不出来，因为那根本不存在，安迪。

928
00:38:47.850 --> 00:38:48.310
No.
没错。

929
00:38:48.570 --> 00:38:52.570
He says he would never be insightful enough to be a movie critic, but he could maybe
他说他永远没有足够的洞察力去当影评人，但他或许可以

930
00:38:52.570 --> 00:38:54.310
be a food or art critic.
当个美食或艺术评论家。

931
00:38:54.450 --> 00:38:54.710
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

932
00:38:55.470 --> 00:38:55.670
Hmm.
嗯。

933
00:38:56.570 --> 00:39:00.170
Here comes Michael in his black turtleneck and his black coat.
迈克尔穿着他的黑色高领毛衣和黑色外套进来了。

934
00:39:00.310 --> 00:39:01.970
I'm still, like, obsessed with this outfit.
我至今仍然对这身装扮着迷。

935
00:39:02.450 --> 00:39:06.290
He said he spent the afternoon in the park trying to feed pigeons, but I guess they'd all
他说他下午在公园里试着喂鸽子，但我猜它们可能都

936
00:39:06.290 --> 00:39:07.890
flown west for the winter.
飞往西方过冬去了。

937
00:39:08.090 --> 00:39:08.310
Yeah.
没错。

938
00:39:08.930 --> 00:39:11.630
And he just had some thoughts he wanted to share with everyone.
他只是有些想法想和大家分享。

939
00:39:12.970 --> 00:39:14.170
Pam says what?
帕姆问什么？

940
00:39:14.810 --> 00:39:15.330
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

941
00:39:15.670 --> 00:39:18.130
And he said, I wrote them down so I wouldn't forget.
他说，我把它们写下来了，这样我就不会忘记。

942
00:39:18.550 --> 00:39:19.170
Oh, boy.
天哪。

943
00:39:19.450 --> 00:39:20.110
Here it comes.
要来了。

944
00:39:20.390 --> 00:39:23.110
This is the Boom Roasteds.
这就是“砰，被吐槽了”。

945
00:39:23.550 --> 00:39:24.370
It is.
没错。

946
00:39:24.470 --> 00:39:25.350
Boom Roasted.
砰，被吐槽了。

947
00:39:25.350 --> 00:39:31.350
So, you know, I told you that Halstead Sullivan came up with the idea for the Roast storyline.
所以，你知道，我告诉过你哈尔斯特德·沙利文想出了吐槽大会剧情的点子。

948
00:39:31.690 --> 00:39:31.870
Yeah.
没错。

949
00:39:32.090 --> 00:39:35.630
I had to know who came up with Boom Roasted.
我必须得知道是谁想出了“砰，被吐槽了”这句台词。

950
00:39:35.830 --> 00:39:36.330
Who did?
是谁想出来的？

951
00:39:36.330 --> 00:39:36.950
All right.
好吧。

952
00:39:37.130 --> 00:39:41.350
I got a hot tip that it might be Justin Spitzer or Gene Stubnitsky.
我得到一个可靠消息，说可能是贾斯汀·斯皮策或吉恩·斯图布尼茨基。

953
00:39:41.570 --> 00:39:41.810
Okay.
好的。

954
00:39:42.150 --> 00:39:43.490
I reached out to them.
我联系了他们。

955
00:39:43.790 --> 00:39:44.170
And?
